Package: sylva
Title: Terrestrial Laser Scanning Processing for Forest Ecology
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tim", "Devereux", email = "devereux.tj@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R interface to Sylva, a Rust library that processes terrestrial
    laser scanning of forest plots from raw pulses to registered clouds,
    trees, quantitative structure models and plant area density. The same
    Rust core serves the Python package, so both give identical results.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc >= 1.80
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/rextendr/version: 0.4
